  verification: Corrected complete suite 64 Node and 27 nested Pester passes, zero skips/cancellations. Actual full 22-file JS/PowerShell materialization and both publisher Node boundaries were exercised. Three actual timeout terminations pass after a native-stderr/exit race was fixed; no new bootstrap or generator coverage percentage is claimed.
  remaining_at_checkpoint: The actual publisher stopped at stale-manifest rejection before public admission. Fresh release identity, unbound transport, model qualification and hosting remain open. No publication, real seed, production receipt, model deletion or measured storage recovery.

